   "resumo_en": "Weekend in London is the fifth studio album by the English rock band the Dave Clark Five. It contains the single \"Come Home\" and covers of \"Blue Suede Shoes\" by Carl Perkins and \"Little Bitty Pretty One\" by Thurston Harris. The album also features \"Hurting Inside\" and \"'Till the Right One Comes Along\", both of which later appeared on a The Dave Clark Five (1971) compilation album. In Canada, it was released as Encores on Capitol Records.",
